WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Wannan bidiyon yana ba da taƙaitaccen gabatarwa ga na'urar Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Kunna shi ta amfani da wannan maɓallin launin toka.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Da farko, duka ƙarshen Arclight na iya zuwa a lokaci guda.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Idan bai kunna kwata-kwata ko fitulun ba su da ƙarfi, baturin na iya zama a kwance.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Toshe shi ta amfani da cajar USB.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Lokacin caji, fitilolin kore zasu kunna.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Bayan minti 15, ya kamata a caje shi sosai kuma yayi aiki na sa'o'i da yawa.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Barin shi a cikin hasken rana zai ci gaba da cajin baturi.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ba za ku buƙaci maye gurbin kowane baturi ko kwararan fitila ba.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Yanayin lokacin da ƙarshen duka suka zo don amfanin gaba ɗaya ne.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Canja zuwa yanayin ido ta hanyar riƙe maɓallin ƙasa na daƙiƙa 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Sa'an nan kuma ɗaga yatsanka kuma da sauri sake danna yayin da hasken ya haskaka.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Yanzu kuna cikin yanayin ido, inda za a kunna ophthalmoscope

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
na farko, sa'an nan kuma na gaba part loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Maimaita waɗannan matakan zai sake zagayowar ta hanyoyi daban-daban na amfani guda uku.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Amfani na gaba ɗaya, idanu, sannan kunnuwa.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Da zarar ka zaɓi yanayin da aka fi so, danna maɓallin launin toka

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
yana canza yadda fitulun ke haskakawa da kuma wane ƙarshen ke haskakawa.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Tabbatar cewa kayi amfani da madaidaicin ƙarshen don gwajin daidai.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Ana bincika ido na waje ta amfani da loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Ra'ayin zai bayyana lokacin da kake kusa da ido a kusa da 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
Ana yin reflex na kuɗi a tsawon hannu ta amfani da ophthalmoscope kai tsaye.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Idan ra'ayi ya ɓaci, to duba akwatin ruwan tabarau yana saman.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
A cikin wannan matsayi, babu ruwan tabarau a cikin rami na gani kuma reflex ya kamata ya bayyana.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
Hakanan ana iya amfani da Arclight don ɗaukar bidiyo na alamun asibiti

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
lokacin da aka haɗe zuwa kyamarar wayar hannu.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Da zarar an haɗa, ramin gani na kai tsaye ophthalmoscope

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
za a sanya shi kai tsaye a tsakiyar ruwan tabarau wanda kyamarar tafi da gidanka ke amfani da ita a yanayin bidiyo.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Kamara za ta yi aiki kamar idanuwan ku lokacin da kuke duba ta cikin rami na gani.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Don tabbatar da wane ruwan tabarau don daidaita ramin gani da shi,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
bude aikace-aikacen bidiyo akan wayarka, sanya yatsanka akan kowane ruwan tabarau bi da bi.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Lokacin da allon yayi duhu, kun rufe ruwan tabarau da aka yi amfani da shi don bidiyo.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Cire takardar rawaya daga bayan shirin.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Sanya wuraren kibiya akan tsakiyar ruwan tabarau da ake amfani da su don ɗaukar bidiyo.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Danna shirin ƙasa da ƙarfi.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Cire kibiya.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Ya kamata shirin yanzu ya kasance a daidai matsayi.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Don bidiyo da reflex, kunna kai tsaye ophthalmoscope

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
ƙarshen Arclight kuma zaɓi haske mafi haske tare da dannawa uku.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Tabbatar cewa akwatin ruwan tabarau yana saman.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Tare da hasken yana fuskantar nesa daga wayar zuwa ga majiyyaci.

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
sanya Arclight a cikin shirin kuma ja na'urar roba don amintacce.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Matsa Arclight sama har sai ya kasa zamewa gaba.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Ramin gani na kai tsaye ophthalmoscope

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
yanzu zai kasance kai tsaye kan tsakiyar ruwan tabarau wanda ke ɗaukar bidiyo.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Don yin rikodin idon waje, yi amfani da ɗayan ƙarshen na'urar.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Don ɗaukar hotuna, buɗe app ɗin bidiyo kuma zuƙowa ciki,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
cika allon tare da kallo ta hanyar ramin gani.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Danna rikodin kuma yi jarrabawa.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Danna tsayawa kuma ajiye bidiyon.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
Yanzu zaku iya rabawa tare da abokan aiki akan amintattun, rufaffiyar dandamali

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
kawai don dalilin da kuka sami izini daga majiyyaci.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Ji daɗin amfani da Arclight a cikin aikin ku.
